      },
      "subscription_status": {
        "target": null,
        "reason": "Modern has no provider-less subscription lifecycle: `subscriptions` is the Stripe object (0017: provider CHECK = 'stripe', plan CHECK pro|enterprise, partial unique index on active rows). The legacy lifecycle (none|active|past_due|grace|expired|cancelled, plus plan_started_at/plan_expires_at/plan_updated_at) therefore has NO target; the user-visible fact is preserved in users.plan. Needs an owner decision \u2014 MG-SCHEMA-MAPPING."
      },
